@startuml
title User Service - Get Own Profile

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Client
boundary "Users Router\napp/routes/users.py" as API
control "Authentication\napp/auth.py" as Auth
control "Profile Response Builder\napp/services/profiles.py" as Profiles

Client -> API: GET /users/me\nBearer token
activate API

ref over API, Auth
  Authenticate request
  See authorizeProtectedRequest.puml
end ref

alt Authentication fails
  API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
else Request is authenticated
  API -> Profiles: own_profile_response(user)
  activate Profiles
  Profiles --> API: Permitted owner profile
  deactivate Profiles
  note right of API
    Password and session information
    are never included.
  end note
  API --> Client: 200 OK + own profile
else Service unavailable
  API --> Client: 503 Service Unavailable
end

deactivate API
@enduml
